	(gr_text "Notes\n\n- target manufacturer: JLC\n	- impedence controlled: stackup JLC06161H-3313\n	- fab general capabilies table: https://jlcpcb.com/events/6-layer-pcb\n	- price range: quoted from JLC 9/18/2026 , https://jlcpcb.com/6-layer-pcb\n		{dblquote}{dblquote}{dblquote}\n 			A 6-layer, 50x50mm board with ENIG 2u{dblquote} surface finish starts at \n			just $2 (for 5 pcs), and larger sizes such as the 6-layer \n			100x100mm boards begin at $35.1 (5 pcs). \n		{dblquote}{dblquote}{dblquote}\n	- 1:1 (0mm) solder mask expansion required; for BGA\n- Hammond Enclosure: https://www.hammfg.com/files/parts/pdf/1593KBK.pdf\n	- general internal dimensions\n		- screw boss height: 			4.5mm\n		- height (in/out of schematic):	22.0mm\n		- length (schematic up/down):	58.66mm\n		- width (schematic left/right):	55.0mm\n	- other noteable dimensions:\n		- SFP height ~8.5mm housing, ~12.36mm socket-end (overhanging pcb)\n	- the mounting screws are infact off center. by like 0.3mm\n"
		(at 18.4 17 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "d055ca1f-2627-4dd8-a92f-59b8f8c2e4ba")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "tightest hold time (500Mhz base clk, ddr) : 210ps ,\neyeballed board propagation: ~8ps/mm ,\neyeballed via propagation between layers 1,3,5: 11ps\n=> 170ps , /3 for good measure, and %20 overall tollerance => \nkeep lengths matched within => 5.6mm\n"
		(at 183.25 106.8 0)
		(layer "User.5")
